ent.\n10. Enrolled girls in mining branch of engineering. \n11. Aggressive role for farmers to get daytime electricity.\n12. Onion subsidy scam in Warora Agricultural Produce Market Committee exposed.\n13. The attention of the House was drawn to the oppression of women.\n14. Urgent role for increase in remuneration of contract employees in all Shiksha Abhiyan.\n15. Fund of Rs. 1 crore given to health system during Corona period.\n16. Distribution of bicycles on birthdays to needy girls.","freedom_fighter":"No","source_biography":"https://sansad.in/api_ls/member/5748?locale=en","reviewed_on":"2026-10-30","oath_recordings":[{"member_id":5748,"title":"OATH OR AFFIRMATION","url":"https://sansad.in/getMedia/stream/file/loksabha/video26024.mp4?source=memberslsmedia","date":"2024-06-25","session":1,"category":"Oath Taking","category_code":21,"source":"https://sansad.in/api_ls/mpDashboard/my-gallery?mpCode=5748&loksabha=18&page=1&size=500&searchText=&sortBy&debCode=&date=","house":"Lok Sabha","loksabha":18}],"latest_oath":{"date":"2024-06-25","source":"https://sansad.in/api_ls/mpDashboard/my-gallery?mpCode=5748&loksabha=18&page=1&size=500&searchText=&sortBy&debCode=&date=","recording":{"member_id":5748,"title":"OATH OR AFFIRMATION","url":"https://sansad.in/getMedia/stream/file/loksabha/video26024.mp4?source=memberslsmedia","date":"2024-06-25","session":1,"category":"Oath Taking","category_code":21,"source":"https://sansad.in/api_ls/mpDashboard/my-gallery?mpCode=5748&loksabha=18&page=1&size=500&searchText=&sortBy&debCode=&date=","house":"Lok Sabha","loksabha":18},"verification":"Member-matched official oath recording","kind":"parliamentary","house":"Lok Sabha"},"oath_date":"2024-06-25","oath_date_source":"https://sansad.in/api_ls/mpDashboard/my-gallery?mpCode=5748&loksabha=18&page=1&size=500&searchText=&sortBy&debCode=&date=","recordings_count":18,"activity_scope":"18th Lok Sabha","activity_manifest":"/data/parliament/ls/5748/index.json","activity_summary":{"questions":{"sta